### Incubation Applications - Comprehensive Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json
@testUserId = test-user-incubation

### 1. Create Incubation Application - Complete Data
# @name createFullIncubation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "user_id": "{{testUserId}}",
    "application_type": "incubation",
    "status": "brouillon",
    "type": "Incubation",
    "data": {
        "project_name": "EcoSmart Recycling Platform",
        "business_model": "B2B SaaS platform connecting businesses with recycling facilities through AI-powered waste classification and route optimization",
        "target_market": "Small to medium enterprises, municipal waste management, recycling facilities, and environmentally conscious corporations",
        "funding_amount": 150000.00,
        "team_size": 5,
        "project_stage": "MVP Complete",
        "description": "Revolutionary platform that uses computer vision and machine learning to optimize waste sorting and recycling processes, reducing environmental impact while increasing profitability for businesses."
    }
}

