### 12. Create Incubation Application - Very Long Text Fields
# @name createLongTextIncubation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "user_id": "{{testUserId}}",
    "application_type": "incubation",
    "status": "brouillon",
    "type": "Incubation",
    "data": {
        "project_name": "Very Long Project Name That Tests The Maximum Length Allowed For Project Names In The Incubation System",
        "business_model": "This is a very long business model description that tests the maximum length allowed for business model fields in the incubation system. It describes a complex multi-tier business model with various revenue streams, customer segments, value propositions, key partnerships, cost structures, and detailed market analysis including competitive landscape, pricing strategies, customer acquisition costs, lifetime value calculations, market penetration strategies, and long-term sustainability plans.",
        "target_market": "This is a very long target market description that includes detailed demographic analysis, geographic segmentation, psychographic profiling, behavioral patterns, market size estimation, total addressable market calculations, serviceable addressable market analysis, serviceable obtainable market projections, market trends, growth patterns, seasonal variations, competitive analysis, customer pain points, unmet needs identification, and comprehensive market research findings.",
        "funding_amount": 999999.99,
        "team_size": 15,
        "project_stage": "Very Long Project Stage Name That Tests Maximum Length",
        "description": "This is a very long description that tests the maximum length allowed for description fields in the incubation system. It provides comprehensive details about the project including technical specifications, implementation roadmap, development milestones, team structure, technology stack, infrastructure requirements, scalability plans, security measures, compliance requirements, intellectual property considerations, risk management strategies, and detailed project timeline with deliverables."
    }
}

